  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 45,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "27",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "GEN 27"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "27",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilyo Isaki akotele, na menso yakwe yanakuka icakuti alafilwa no kumona, aitile umwana mwaume mukalamba Esau, amweba ati, “We mwana wandi!” Nao mwane ayasuka ati, “Epo ndi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaki amweba ati, “Mona, nomba ninkota, kabili nshishibe no bushiku ningafwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanshi nomba buula ifyanso fyobe, imifwi yobe no buta bobe, uye mu mpanga mukulunga, unjipaileko inama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo wise umpekanishisheko icakulya icanunkila, cilya natemwa, ulete njise ndye. Epakuti nkupaale ilyo nshilafwa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanshi Rebeka aleumfwako ilyo Isaki alelanda kuli mwane Esau. Ilyo aile mu mpanga mukulunga inama nokuti alete, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rebeka aeba mwane Yakobo ati, “Mona, naumfwako ifyo bawiso bacilaeba munonko Esau, baleti, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Undetele inama elyo umpekanishishe icakulya icanunkila icakuti ndye, uleke nkupaale pa cinso cakwa Yawe ilyo nshilafwa.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanshi we mwana wandi, umfwa bwino kuli ine, ucite nefyo ndekweba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabiye ku mukuni wa mbushi, undeteleko utwana twa mbushi tubili utusuma pakuti njise mpekanishishe bawiso icakulya icanunkila umusango bacitemenwamo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo wise utwalile bawiso balye pakuti bakupaale ilyo bashilafwa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lelo Yakobo aebele nyina Rebeka ati, “Munyinane Esau muntu uwamapipi, lelo ine ndi muntu wa mubili uwatelela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga cakuti batata baya mpampanta, cileya moneka kwati ndebomfya ubucenjeshi. Lyena ninshi te paalo ndeya poka, lelo kuiletelelafye ukulapishiwa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyina amweba ati, “We mwana wandi, leka uko kulapishiwa kukese pali ine. Iwe citafye ifyo nandile. Kabiye, kandetele utwana twa mbushi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanshi Yakobo epakuya buula utwana twa mbushi, atuleta kuli nyina. Nyina nao epakupekanya icakulya icanunkila mu musango wishi atemenwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo Rebeka abuula ifyakufwala ifyawamishe ifyali mu ŋanda ifya mwana mukalamba Esau, afwika no mwana wakwe mwaice Yakobo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo apomba impapa sha twana twa mbushi ku maboko yakwa Yakobo na mu mukoshi umushali mapipi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apeela mwane Yakobo mu minwe icakulya icanunkila no mukate apangile.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo aya kuli wishi, asosa ati, “Tata wandi!” Wishi nao ayasuka ati, “Epo ndi. Niwe ani we mwana wandi?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo ayasuka wishi ati, “Nine Esau ibeli lyenu. Nincita ifyo mwacinjeba. Aleni imeni mulyeko inama yandi, pakuti mumpeele ipaalo lyenu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaki aipusha mwane ati, “We mwana wandi, apa pene epo wasanga inama?” Yakobo ayasuka ati, “Ni Yawe, Lesa wenu uwampeela ishuko.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo Isaki aebele Yakobo ati, “Palama kuno mwana wandi uleke nkupampante, pakuti njishibe nga cine niwe mwana wandi Esau nangu iyoo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo epakupalama kuli wishi Isaki. Wishi nao alamupampanta elyo asosa ati, “Ishiwi lyena lishiwi lyakwa Yakobo, lelo amaboko yena maboko yakwa Esau.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaki taishibe ukuti ni Yakobo pantu amaboko yakwe yali na mapipi kwati yakwa Esau munyina. Kanshi Isaki epakupaala Yakobo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lelo Isaki amwipusha ati, “Bushe cine cine niwe mwana wandi Esau?” Yakobo ayasuka ati, “Ee nine wine.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo Isaki asosa ati, “Mwana wandi, ndetelako inama wipeye mukulunga, uleke ndye, pakuti nkupaale.” Yakobo epakumuletela inama no kulya alya. Amuletelako no mwangashi, nao anwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo Isaki wishi amweba ati, “Palama kuno mwana wandi untomone pakumposha.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.11.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bahi 11:20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanshi Yakobo epakuya tomona Isaki pakumuposha. Cilya Isaki aumfwa icena ca nsalu shakwe, alamupaala, no kusosa ati,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atilefye cilya Isaki apwa ukupaala Yakobo, na Yakobo afuma pali wishi, Esau munyina nao abwela kukulunga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esau nao apekanya icakulya icanunkila, atwala na kuli wishi. Elyo aeba wishi ati, “Tata wandi, imeni mulyeko inama njipeye kukulunga pakuti mumpeele ne paalo lyenu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaki wishi amwipusha ati, “Bushe niwe ani?” Nao ayasuka ati, “Nine mwana wenu, ibeli lyenu Esau.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaki epakulakanka no mwenso ukalamba ati, “Nga kanshi uwacibamba inama no kundetela nani? Nalyafye ili line ninshi taulaisa elyo nimupaala, kabili nalala napaalwa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cilya Esau aumfwa ifyo wishi alanda, alila umusowa uukalamba kabili uukali, alaeba wishi ati, “Mpaaleni, na ine, tata wandi!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lelo Isaki amweba ati, “Munonko acisa mu bucenjeshi, napoka ne paalo lyobe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.25.29+GEN.25.30+GEN.25.31+GEN.25.32+GEN.25.33+GEN.25.34"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Icite 25:29-34",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esau epakusosa ati, “Bushe tacalungama ukumwinika ishina lya Yakobo? Nomba ancenjesha imiku ibili. Alimpokele insambu sha bubeli bwandi. Kabili apoka ne paalo.” Elyo aipusha ati, “Bushe tamunshilileko ipaalo?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaki ayasuka Esau ati, “Mona nimusonta ukuba imfumu yobe, kabili nimupeela ba lupwa lwakwe bonse ukuba ababomfi bakwe. Elyo nimupeela ifyakumusunga, ifisabo elyo no mwangashi upya. Kanshi finshi fimbi ningakucitila mwana wandi?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.12.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bahi 12:17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esau aebele wishi ati, “Bushe tata mwakwatafye ipaalo limo epela? Tata wandi mpaaleniko na ine wine!” Elyo Esau asansula ishiwi lyakwe alalila.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
