    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanshi Esau nomba alipatile Yakobo, pa mulandu we paalo wishi amupeele. Alaisosha umwine ati, “Inshiku shakuloosha batata shilifye mupepi. Elyo ninshi nkepaya munyinane Yakobo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilyo Rebeka bamwebeleko ifyo umwana mukalamba Esau alandile, Rebeka epakutuma abakwita Yakobo umwana mwaice. Amweba ati, “Mona munonko Esau aleitalalika umutima ne pange lya kukwipaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanshi nomba we mwana wandi, cita ifyo nalakweba, fulumukila kuli ndume yandi Labani ku Harani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uye ikala nankwe pa nshita ino mpaka munonko icipyu cikapwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilyo munonko akaleka ukukufulilwa kabili akalabe nefyo wamucita, elyo nkakutumina amashiwi ukabwelulukeko. Nga cinshi ningalekela ukuti ndufye abana bandi bonse babili mu bushiku bumo bwine?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.45"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
